
 >> x := Into entsha.
 >> y := Into entsha.
 >> z := x.
 Imveliso bhala: ( x iyafana: y ), umgca-omtsha.
 Imveliso bhala: ( x iyafana: z ), umgca-omtsha.
 Imveliso bhala: ( x = y ), umgca-omtsha.
 Imveliso bhala: ( x = z ), umgca-omtsha.
 Imveliso bhala: ( x ≠ y ), umgca-omtsha.
 Imveliso bhala: ( x ≠ z ), umgca-omtsha.
 